#. 俺はようやく確信に至ったべ。
#. この件には“ある組織”が絡んでいるんだ…
msgctxt "0001 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"A certain organization is behind all of this, I'm\n"
"finally sure of it...!"
msgstr ""

#. だが、その組織の名前だけは言えん。
#. 口にしたら最後、消されてしまうからだ…
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"But I can't say their name, cuz as soon as you do,\n"
"they come and...get rid of you."
msgstr ""

#. ジョンレノンもカートコバーンも、
#. みんなその組織に消されたんだ。
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Kurt Cobain said their name. John Lennon said their\n"
"name!"
msgstr ""

#. ヤバいヤバいヤバいって…
#. 本格的にヤバいべ…
msgctxt "0004 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "They're bad...so bad...really really bad!"
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に過ごす
msgctxt "0005 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Spend some time with Hiro"
msgstr ""

#. 他の場所へ行く
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Go see who else is around"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…どうしよう？
#. こんな葉隠クンと一緒に過ごせるか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Should I spend time with Hiro while he's in\n"
"this kind of mood?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だったら、男２人で熱く語り合うべ。
#. 宇宙発生論についてな。
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Well then, why don't we have a heated discussion about\n"
"cosmogony!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>宇宙発生論について、
#. 葉隠クンの一方的な見解を述べられた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I learned all about Hiro's theories on the origin of\n"
"the universe...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hiro and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0012 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Hiro a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
